  "content": "<p>Find your people!</p>\n<h2>Local Events</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://happyvalleyanimationfestival.org/\" title=\"https://happyvalleyanimationfestival.org/\">Happy Valley Animation Festival</a></p>\n<h2>Conference Volunteering</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://sv.siggraph.org/\">SIGGRAPH SV Program</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://igda.org/gdc2020-2/volunteer/\">IDGA</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Groups</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Penn State University Park: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/PSUDigitalMedia/\">Penn State Digital Media Group</a></li>\n<li>Penn State World Campus: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/psudmdclub/\">DMD Program Club</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.meetup.com/topics/3d-animation/\">Meetup.com</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/3dmodelingandanimation/\">3D Modeling and Animation Facebook Group</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ACMSIGGRAPH/\">ACM SIGGRAPH Facebook Group</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ACMSIGGRAPHS3/\">SIGGRAPH S3 Facebook Group</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Animtion societies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ASIFAInternational/\">ASIFA International</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/asifasouth/\">ASIFA South</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Underrepresented groups</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wia.animation/\">Women in Animation:</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://greatwomenanimators.com/\">http://greatwomenanimators.com/</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.bwastudios.com/\">Black Women Animate Studios</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"http://www.panimation.tv/\">Trans, Non-binary Motion Graphics Artist Directory</a></li>\n</ul>\n"
